k" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> <!-- -->3<!-- --> single-video <!-- -->packages</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> <!-- -->3<!-- --> hour-based monthly <!-- -->plans</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> Scope confirmed before work</span></div></div></section><section id="editing-packs" data-analytics-region="pricing" class="pack-options pack-container" aria-labelledby="editing-packs-title"><div class="pack-options-intro"><div><h2 id="editing-packs-title">Choose the edit you need.</h2><p>One clear price for one finished video, with limits shown up front.</p></div><a href="#pack-comparison" class="pack-text-link">Compare every detail <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="pack-type-switch neo-inset" data-kind="single" role="group" aria-label="Choose a pricing option"><span class="pack-type-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">Single video</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">Monthly packages</button></div><div class="pack-grid pack-grid--3"><article id="pack-single-creator" class="pack-card neo-card pack-card--recommended" aria-labelledby="pack-single-creator-name"><div class="pack-card-topline"><span class="pack-card-icon neo-icon-badge" aria-hidden="true