><path d="m302 80-24-24" class="editing-artwork__line"></path></g></g><g class="editing-artwork__raised"><circle cx="62" cy="219" r="27" class="editing-artwork__surface"></circle><path d="m51 219 8 8 15-17" class="editing-artwork__accent-line"></path></g></svg></div><div class="pack-step-copy"><span class="pack-step-number">02 / THE EDIT</span><h3>We make the cut</h3><p>Your editor shapes the story within your single-video scope or reserved monthly editing hours.</p></div></li><li class="neo-card"><div class="pack-step-art"><svg class="editing-artwork editing-artwork--review" viewBox="0 0 360 270" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="181" cy="137" rx="138" ry="116" class="editing-artwork__halo"></ellipse><g class="editing-artwork__raised" transform="rotate(-4 172 140)"><rect x="43" y="45" width="254" height="187" rx="20" class="editing-artwork__surface"></rect><circle cx="62" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><circle cx="73" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><circle cx="84" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><rect x="57" y="77" width="226" height="96" rx="11" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect><g class="editing-artwork__scene editing-artwork__scene--landscape"><path d="m67 161 46-59 45 59H67Zm76 0 51-73 77 73H143Z" class="editing-artwork__slate-light"></path><circle cx="252" cy="96" r="9" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle></g><rect x="146" y="101" width="49" height="42" rx="13" class="editing-artwork__accent"></rect><path d="m164 111 15 11-15 11v-22Z" fill="white"></path><rect x="57" y="185" width="226" height="33" rx="9" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect><rect x="66" y="194" width="51" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__slate-light"></rect><rect x="121" y="194" width="88" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__slate"></rect><rect x="213" y="194" width="59" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__rose"></rect><path d="M184 180v43" class="editing-artwork__accent-line editing-artwork__playhead"></path></g><g class="editing-artwork__float editing-artwork__raised"><path d="M233 26h83c10 0 18 8 18 18v40c0 10-8 18-18 18h-41l-19 15v-15h-23c-10 0-18-8-18-18V44c0-10 8-18 18-18Z" class="editing-artwork__surface"></path><path d="m250 64 12 12 26-28" class="editing-artwork__accent-line"></path><rect x="298" y="54" width="17" height="5" rx="2.5" class="editing-artwork__slate"></rect><rect x="298" y="66" width="12" height="5" rx="2.5" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect></g><g class="editing-artwork__raised"><circle cx="62" cy="219" r="27" class="editing-artwork__surface"></circle><path d="m51 219 8 8 15-17" class="editing-artwork__accent-line"></path></g></svg></div><div class="pack-step-copy"><span class="pack-step-number">03 / YOUR NEXT UPLOAD</span><h3>Review, then publish</h3><p>Share feedback within your included revision rounds or monthly hours, then receive your finished edit.</p></div></li></ol></section><section id="pack-comparison" class="pack-comparison pack-container" aria-labelledby="comparison-title"><div class="pack-section-heading"><h2 id="comparison-title">Compare <!-- -->single-video scope<!-- -->.</h2><p>Pick the option that fits the work you have ready.</p></div><p class="pack-table-hint">Scroll to compare all packages on smaller screens.</p><div class="pack-table-scroll neo-surface" role="region" aria-label="Single-video package comparison" tabindex="0"><table><caption class="sr-only">Single-video scope, turnaround, and prices</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Package details</th><th scope="col"><span>Creator Video</span><small>$109<!-- --> <!-- -->/ video</small></th><th scope="col"><span>Studio Video</span><small>$179<!-- --> <!-- -->/ video</small></th><th scope="col"><span>Feature Video</span><small>$249<!-- --> <!-- -->/ video</small></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Price per edit</th><td>$109</td><td>$179</td><td>$249</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Deliverable</th><td>One standard long-form edit</td><td>One enhanced long-form edit</td><td>One feature-length edit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Finished length</th><td>Up to 8 minutes</td><td>Up to 15 minutes</td><td>Up to 30 minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Raw footage</th><td>Up to 60 minutes</td><td>Up to 120 minutes</td><td>Up to 240 minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Revisions</th><td>1 round</td><td>2 rounds</td><td>3 rounds</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First-cut target</th><td>48 hours</td><td>48 hours</td><td>48 hours</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope="row">Choose a package</th><td><a class="pack-text-link" href="/checkout/single-creator" data-discover="true">Choose <!-- -->Creator Video<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></td><td><a class="pack-text-link" href="/checkout/single-studio" data-discover="true">Choose <!-- -->Studio Video<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></td><td><a class="pack-text-link" href="/checkout/single-feature" data-discover="true">Choose <!-- -->Feature Video<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></td></tr></tfoot></table></div></section><section class="site-faq " aria-labelledby="_R_akj5_"><div class="site-faq__intro"><p class="site-faq__kicker neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>FAQ</p><h2 class="site-faq__title" id="_R_akj5_">Know what’s included.</h2><p class="site-faq__description">Straight answers on editing scope, monthly hours, and what happens next.</p></div><div class="site-faq__list"><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_mqkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_mqkj5_-answer"><span>How does monthly editing time work?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_mqkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_mqkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Your package reserves the listed editing hours across a standard 22-workday month. Editing, feedback rounds, and included finishing work draw from that time. We agree the scope and schedule with you before production starts.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_16qkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_16qkj5_-answer"><span>Are unused monthly hours carried over?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_16qkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_16qkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>No. Each package is a monthly capacity reservation, so unused hours expire at the end of that package month. We’ll help prioritize the work that fits your available time.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_1mqkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1mqkj5_-answer"><span>How is a single-video package different?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_1mqkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1mqkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>A single-video package is priced per deliverable, with a finished-length limit, raw-footage limit, and revision allowance. Open its package page for the full scope and first-cut target. Choose one when you have a specific edit rather than recurring monthly work.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_26qkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_26qkj5_-answer"><span>Can I ask for work outside the listed scope?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_26qkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_26qkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Yes. Longer edits, extra source footage, custom VFX, project files, and work beyond reserved monthly hours can be quoted separately. We confirm any added price and timing before work begins.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_2mqkj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2mqkj5_-answer"><span>Can I pay online today?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2mqkj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2mqkj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Yes. Checkout accepts cryptocurrency through Cryptomus. You can choose a supported coin and network on the hosted payment page.</p></div></div></article></div></section><section class="pack-final pack-container neo-surface" aria-labelledby="final-title"><div class="pack-final-copy"><p class="neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clapperboard" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12.296 3.464 3.02 3.956"></path><path d="M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3z"></path><path d="M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><path d="m6.18 5.276 3.1 3.899"></path></svg>Make room to create</p><h2 id="final-title">Your next video.<br/>Our next great cut.</h2><p>One finished video or a steady editing partner. Choose the support that fits your channel.</p><div class="pack-final-actions"><a href="#editing-packs" class="neo-button pack-button">Find my package <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="pack-text-link" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Let’s talk first <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><p class="pack-final-note"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Clear scope before editing starts.</p></div><div class="pack-final-art"><svg class="editing-artwork editing-artwork--review" viewBox="0 0 360 270" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="181" cy="137" rx="138" ry="116" class="editing-artwork__halo"></ellipse><g class="editing-artwork__raised" transform="rotate(-4 172 140)"><rect x="43" y="45" width="254" height="187" rx="20" class="editing-artwork__surface"></rect><circle cx="62" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><circle cx="73" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><circle cx="84" cy="61" r="3" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle><rect x="57" y="77" width="226" height="96" rx="11" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect><g class="editing-artwork__scene editing-artwork__scene--landscape"><path d="m67 161 46-59 45 59H67Zm76 0 51-73 77 73H143Z" class="editing-artwork__slate-light"></path><circle cx="252" cy="96" r="9" class="editing-artwork__slate"></circle></g><rect x="146" y="101" width="49" height="42" rx="13" class="editing-artwork__accent"></rect><path d="m164 111 15 11-15 11v-22Z" fill="white"></path><rect x="57" y="185" width="226" height="33" rx="9" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect><rect x="66" y="194" width="51" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__slate-light"></rect><rect x="121" y="194" width="88" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__slate"></rect><rect x="213" y="194" width="59" height="15" rx="4" class="editing-artwork__rose"></rect><path d="M184 180v43" class="editing-artwork__accent-line editing-artwork__playhead"></path></g><g class="editing-artwork__float editing-artwork__raised"><path d="M233 26h83c10 0 18 8 18 18v40c0 10-8 18-18 18h-41l-19 15v-15h-23c-10 0-18-8-18-18V44c0-10 8-18 18-18Z" class="editing-artwork__surface"></path><path d="m250 64 12 12 26-28" class="editing-artwork__accent-line"></path><rect x="298" y="54" width="17" height="5" rx="2.5" class="editing-artwork__slate"></rect><rect x="298" y="66" width="12" height="5" rx="2.5" class="editing-artwork__inset"></rect></g><g class="editing-artwork__raised"><circle cx="62" cy="219" r="27" class="editing-artwork__surface"></circle><path d="m51 219 8 8 15-17" class="editing-artwork__accent-line"></path></g></svg></div></section></div></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Explore<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Explore"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/why-hire-us" data-discover="true">Why Hire Us</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/services" data-discover="true">Services</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Pricing</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Portfolio</a></nav></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Support<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Support"><a class="neo-footer-